{"content_html": "<html><body><div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<section>\n\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<h2><strong>Kết quả bóng đá hôm nay</strong></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>NGÀY GIỜ</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>TRẬN ĐẤU</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>KÊNH TRỰC TIẾP</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>ASEAN CUP 2026 – BÁN KẾT LƯỢT VỀ</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>19/08  20:00</p>\n</td>\n<td>Việt Nam 2-0 Malaysia</td>\n<td>\n<p>VTV6, FPT Play, TV360</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>UEFA CHAMPIONS LEAGUE 2026/27 – PLAY OFF VÒNG LOẠI</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>20/08  02:00</p>\n</td>\n<td>Celtic 3-0 LASK Linz</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NEC Nijmegen 1-3 Bodo Glimt</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Slovan Bratislava 1-1 NK Celje</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>H.Beer Sheva 2-1 Sabah Baku</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>VĐQG TÂY BAN NHA 2026/27 – VÒNG 1</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>20/08  02:00</p>\n</td>\n<td>Atletico Madrid 2-0 Malaga</td>\n<td>\n<p>SCTV 15, VTV Cab</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><strong>COPA LIBERTADORES 2026/27 – VÒNG 1/8</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>20/08  05:00</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Cerro Porteno - Palmeiras</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>Coquimbo Unido - Platense</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p>20/08  07:30</p>\n</td>\n<td>Flamengo - Cruzeiro</td>\n<td>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<p><em>Xem ASEAN Cup 2026 trực tiếp và trọn vẹn trên FPT Play, tại:<a href=\"http://fptplay.vn/\">http://fptplay.vn</a>  </em></p>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<article><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn/lich-thi-dau-bong-da-ngoai-hang-anh-2026-27-moi-nhat-2544730.html\" title=\"Lịch thi đấu bóng đá Ngoại hạng Anh 2026/27 mới nhất\"><picture><img al